	'problems' => "The same data is typed into several places | One shared system holds each record once, so that a change made by one person is correct for everyone.\nOnly one person understands the spreadsheet | We move the rules out of a fragile file and into software that the whole team can use safely.\nOff-the-shelf tools nearly fit | We can build the missing part, or connect existing tools, rather than replacing everything.\nYou cannot see where work stands | Dashboards and status tracking replace phone calls asking whether a job has been done.",
	'benefits' => "Built to your process | Screens and workflows match how your team already thinks about the work\nRole-based access | Each person sees and changes only what their job requires\nReports you actually use | The figures you currently compile by hand are generated when you need them\nRoom to grow | New features can be added in stages as the business changes\nYour data stays yours | You keep access to your data, and we agree how it is backed up",
	'workflow' => "Map the current process | We sit with the people doing the work and write down what really happens, including the exceptions.\nAgree the first version | We pick the smallest useful version, so that value arrives early and spending stays under control.\nBuild in stages | You see working software at regular points, not a finished surprise at the end.\nTest with real scenarios | Your team tries it with real examples before anyone depends on it.\nMove data and train | We bring existing records across and train the people who will use it daily.\nSupport and improve | We fix issues and add to the system as you learn what would help most.",
	'use_cases' => "A service business tracking jobs, staff and invoices across spreadsheets\nA trader or distributor managing stock and orders across branches\nAn institution handling admissions, fees or records on paper\nA growing company that has outgrown a tool it adopted years ago",
	'faqs' => "Is custom software only for large companies? | No. A small tool that removes hours of repeated work each week can be worthwhile for a small business, especially if the first version is kept focused.\nHow much does custom software cost? | It depends on scope, which is why we start with the smallest useful version. After understanding your process, we give a written quote for that stage.\nWhat happens to our existing data? | We review it early, clean up what we can with your help, and import it during rollout so that your history is not lost.\nWhat if our process changes later? | That is one of the reasons to build custom software. We plan for changes and can extend the system in later stages.",
	'cta_text' => 'Show us the spreadsheet your business depends on, and we will tell you honestly whether software would help.',
	'related_services' => 'crm-business-management-software,web-application-development,digital-transformation',
	'form_label' => 'Custom Software Development',
	'seo' => array('Custom Software Development in Tirunelveli | GIRZOCK', 'Custom business software from GIRZOCK Technologies in Thisaiyanvilai. Replace spreadsheets and paper registers with systems built around your process.', 'software development company in Tirunelveli'),
),

