	'use_cases' => "A field service or delivery team recording work on site\nA business with regular repeat customers\nA membership, booking or loyalty service used often\nAn internal tool that has to work offline",
	'faqs' => "Do I need an app or a website? | If people will use it rarely, or find you through search, a website is usually better. If they use it often or it needs device features, an app can be worth it.\nAndroid first or both platforms? | That depends on your users. Many Indian consumer audiences are mainly on Android, but check your own customers before you decide.\nWhat are the costs after launch? | Expect store developer accounts, hosting for the backend and regular updates as phone operating systems change.\nCan you publish it to the app stores for me? | We can prepare and help with submission. The account should normally be in your business name, and each store's review rules apply.",
